and retaining walls in the Italian Garden NW of Belton House|grade=II|access-date=28 January 2023|ref=none}} *Terrace Wall: {{NHLE|num=1187977|desc=Terrace Wall, Steps and Urns in the Italian Garden NW of Belton House|grade=II|access-date=28 January 2023|ref=none}} *Lion Exedra: {{NHLE|num=1194864|desc= Lion Exedra at the S end of the Italian Garden at Belton House|grade=II|access-date=28 January 2023|ref=none}}</ref> To the north of the house, on the terrace are two pairs of statues, and urns, eight further urns on the main garden axis, two [[cistern]]s in the Dutch garden, and a statue, all listed Grade II, while the culminating sundial is listed at Grade II*.<ref> *North Terrace Statues: {{NHLE|num=1187973|desc=Pair of Statues on North Terrace at Belton House|grade=II|access-date=28 January 2023|ref=none}} *North Terrace Steps and Statues: {{NHLE|num=1187976|desc=Steps and pair of Statues on North Terrace at Belton House|grade=II|access-date=28 January 2023|ref=none}} *North Terrace Urns: {{NHLE|num=1298443|desc= Pair of Garden Urns on North Terrace at Belton House|grade=II|access-date=28 January 2023|ref=none}} *Eight Urns: {{NHLE|num=1235725|desc=Eight Garden Urns flanking the main garden axis N of Belton House|grade=II|access-date=28 January 2023|ref=none}} *Pair of Cisterns: {{NHLE|num=1235887|desc=Two Cisterns in the Dutch Garden N of Belton House|grade=II|access-date=28 January 2023|ref=none}} *Statue: {{NHLE|num=1187975|desc=Statue at the N end of the main garden axis NE of Belton House|grade=II|access-date=28 January 2023|ref=none}} *Sundial: {{NHLE|num=1235882|desc=Sundial 150M N of Belton House|grade=II*|access-date=28 January 2023|ref=none}}</ref>

